@shipmentPayloadId = a6f3c0e0-0001-4000-8000-000000000003

### Event read:payload — provider loads the row from its DB and emits the
### full source-shaped payload. No follow-up OData read on the consumer.
POST http://localhost:4455/odata/v4/logistics/emitShipmentPayloadTest
Content-Type: application/json

{"ID": "{{shipmentPayloadId}}"}

###
GET http://localhost:4107/odata/v4/example/Shipments?$filter=id eq {{shipmentPayloadId}}

### Remove local copy, emit payload again — upsert without remote read.
DELETE http://localhost:4107/odata/v4/example/Shipments(id={{shipmentPayloadId}})

POST http://localhost:4455/odata/v4/logistics/emitShipmentPayloadTest
Content-Type: application/json

{"ID": "{{shipmentPayloadId}}"}

###
GET http://localhost:4107/odata/v4/example/Shipments?$filter=id eq {{shipmentPayloadId}}
